        "title": "In many countries, people now wear western-style dresses such as suits and jeans rather than traditional clothing. Why is this? Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>In many countries, people now wear western-style dresses such as suits and jeans rather than traditional clothing. Why is this? Is this a positive or negative development?</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Theo Logical Framework &copy;</a></strong></span></h3>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>1.</strong></u><u><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Ở nhiều quốc gia, người ta hiện nay mặc trang phục kiểu phương T&acirc;y như vest v&agrave; quần jeans thay v&igrave; trang phục truyền thống.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời cho hai c&acirc;u hỏi: Tại sao? Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z4XudfzsWo1hYxxjtZAlg93tgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">replace traditional attire <em>(thay thế trang phục truyền thống)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z4XudfzsWo1hYxxjtZAlg93tgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Western-style clothing <em>(trang phục phương T&acirc;y)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>2.</strong></u><u><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n body:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy;</strong> với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực hơn l&agrave; t&iacute;ch cực. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 body như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y những l&yacute; do dẫn đến xu hướng tr&ecirc;n.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UeCkdNayooZiasxvZUwlLX1Ag6e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n, tập trung v&agrave;o những t&aacute;c hại (ti&ecirc;u cực) đ&aacute;ng kể.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\">Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework &copy; </strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></u></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><u><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></u></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>3.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 1:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y những nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n dẫn đến xu hướng n&agrave;y.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUASdElQvoKx2dxK8CPlNySngNh\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> C&oacute; hai l&yacute; do ch&iacute;nh khiến mọi người th&iacute;ch quần &aacute;o phương T&acirc;y hơn trang phục truyền thống.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EhAKduRVtozGhBxiB00lJOeJgpg\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BRGIdxov0obAOGxmVkplSD9Hgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Thứ nhất, thời trang phương T&acirc;y như quần jeans v&agrave; &aacute;o ph&ocirc;ng <em>được thiết kế để thoải m&aacute;i v&agrave; dễ di chuyển (is designed for comfort and ease of movement)</em>, khiến n&oacute; trở n&ecirc;n l&yacute; tưởng cho lối sống hiện đại năng động.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGkvdtV7QocvBrxOjKjlKyzfgxW\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Mọi người c&oacute; thể đi lại, l&agrave;m việc v&agrave; tập thể dục m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng bị hạn chế như quần &aacute;o truyền thống thường g&acirc;y ra, v&igrave; nhiều trang phục truyền thống <em>đ&ograve;i hỏi phải cẩn thận xử l&yacute; v&agrave; &iacute;t ph&ugrave; hợp với (require careful handling and are less suited to)</em> sinh hoạt h&agrave;ng ng&agrave;y hơn.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LomRd9TpyoUvLcx5E0LlplmegOd\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MRsjdZr5GoBlAvxKQPWlySqQgtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Thứ hai, nhiều nơi l&agrave;m việc đ&atilde; &aacute;p dụng trang phục c&ocirc;ng sở phương T&acirc;y l&agrave;m <em>ti&ecirc;u chuẩn cho quy định về trang phục (the standard dress code)</em>.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeOdtcpUor6lwxT5RllVJIqg3d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Vest v&agrave; trang phục trang trọng được c&ocirc;ng nhận rộng r&atilde;i l&agrave; chuy&ecirc;n nghiệp tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n cầu, v&igrave; vậy nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n trong c&aacute;c văn ph&ograve;ng c&ocirc;ng ty v&agrave; c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty quốc tế phải tu&acirc;n theo những kỳ vọng n&agrave;y để <em>thể hiện m&igrave;nh c&oacute; năng lực v&agrave; đ&aacute;ng tin cậy (appear competent and credible)</em>.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>4.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Body 2:</strong></u></span></h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\">Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n, tập trung v&agrave;o những t&aacute;c hại (ti&ecirc;u cực) đ&aacute;ng kể .</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcaTd0qtvosLXNxEWJYl86aqguf\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng sự chuyển đổi sang quần &aacute;o phương T&acirc;y n&agrave;y chủ yếu l&agrave; c&oacute; hại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UBcIdayxBoQudvx40eflulutgEJ\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0RWdd0gGohd0Ax0nyXl0nU8gxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Quan trọng nhất, quần &aacute;o truyền thống <em>đại diện cho biểu tượng văn h&oacute;a độc đ&aacute;o (represent unique cultural symbols)</em> v&agrave; di sản x&aacute;c định bản sắc của một cộng đồng.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LVmDdpcQZou1gtxLfvDliE7Ag0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Khi mọi người <em>từ bỏ trang phục truyền thống (abandon traditional dress)</em>, những biểu tượng n&agrave;y dần phai nhạt, khiến thế hệ trẻ mất kết nối với cội nguồn của họ v&agrave; l&agrave;m cho lễ hội văn h&oacute;a k&eacute;m ch&acirc;n thực hơn.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RmyjdZ9o8opKQSxeuvdlQjv7goe\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VrffdGtWqoUrsWxhqQil9vG8gDf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, <em>trang phục truyền thống (traditional garments)</em> li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>tay nghề kh&eacute;o l&eacute;o v&agrave; nghệ thuật (skilled craftsmanship and artistry)</em> được truyền qua nhiều thế hệ.&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PYYbdi98XonchyxON1jlisbJguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> <em>Quần &aacute;o phương T&acirc;y sản xuất h&agrave;ng loạt (Mass-produced Western clothes) </em>thiếu gi&aacute; trị nghệ thuật được t&igrave;m thấy trong trang phục truyền thống l&agrave;m thủ c&ocirc;ng, dẫn đến việc <em>c&aacute;c nghệ nh&acirc;n truyền thống (traditional artisans)</em> mất thu nhập v&agrave; động lực để tiếp tục c&ocirc;ng việc của họ. Kết quả l&agrave;, <em>c&aacute;c kỹ thuật h&agrave;ng thế kỷ (centuries-old techniques)</em> v&agrave; kỹ năng văn h&oacute;a kh&ocirc;ng thể thay thế đang biến mất, đại diện cho một mất m&aacute;t đ&aacute;ng kể đối với sự đa dạng văn h&oacute;a của nh&acirc;n loại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><u><strong>5.</strong></u><u><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></u></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdlPdqIm7oFNU8x4jNLlhDiKguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">the prevalence of Western clothing <em>(sự phổ biến của trang phục phương T&acirc;y)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdlPdqIm7oFNU8x4jNLlhDiKguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">erode cultural identity <em>(g&acirc;y x&oacute;i m&ograve;n bản sắc văn ho&aacute;)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2320,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>In many parts of the world, Western-style clothing such as suits and jeans has increasingly replaced traditional attire. This trend can be attributed to the practicality of modern fashion and professional expectations, and I believe it is a largely negative development.</p>",
            "question_id": 19451,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2321,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>There are two primary reasons why people prefer Western clothes over traditional garments. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Firstly, Western fashion such as jeans and t-shirts is designed for comfort and ease of movement, making it ideal for active modern lifestyles. As a result, people can commute, work, and exercise without the restrictions that traditional clothing often imposes, as many traditional outfits require careful handling and are less suited to daily routines.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Secondly, many workplaces have adopted Western business attire as the standard dress code. To be more specific, suits and formal wear are widely recognized as professional globally, so employees in corporate offices and international companies must conform to these expectations to appear competent and credible.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 19451,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2322,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that this shift toward Western clothing is predominantly detrimental.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Most significantly, traditional clothing represents unique cultural symbols and heritage that define a community's identity. Hence, when people abandon traditional dress, these symbols gradually fade, causing younger generations to lose connection to their roots and making cultural festivals less authentic.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, traditional garments involve skilled craftsmanship and artistry passed down through generations. To illustrate, mass-produced Western clothes lack the artistic value found in handmade traditional costumes, leading traditional artisans to lose income and motivation to continue their work. Consequently, centuries-old techniques and irreplaceable cultural skills are disappearing, representing a significant loss to humanity's cultural diversity.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 19451,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2323,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, while the prevalence of Western clothing stems from its convenience and workplace requirements, I believe this development is largely negative as it erodes cultural identity and threatens traditional craftsmanship.</p>",
